:R-HSA-113501  a            obo:GO_0008150 , owl:NamedIndividual ;
        rdfs:comment        "During S phase of the cell cycle, RB1 is dephosphorylated by the PP2A protein phosphatase complex. Unphosphorylated RB1 associates with DNA damage sites in S phase, preventing initiation of DNA replication from these sites (Knudsen et al. 2000, Avni et al. 2003)." ;
        rdfs:label          "Inhibition of replication initiation of damaged DNA by RB1/E2F1" ;
        dc:contributor      "GOC:reactome_curators" ;
